WEBVTT

00:00:00.115 --> 00:00:01.930
Dance Floor Ready is fully online.

00:00:02.055 --> 00:00:05.620
Practice at home in short bursts,
and I’ll give you private video feedback.

00:00:06.050 --> 00:00:07.135
No studio commute.

00:00:07.425 --> 00:00:11.273
On Day 1, put on a song you know
and film 30 seconds.

00:00:11.599 --> 00:00:13.638
Even stepping side to side counts.

00:00:13.837 --> 00:00:16.863
Send it to me privately so I can see
where you’re starting.

00:00:17.026 --> 00:00:19.990
That first clip is for tracking your progress.

00:00:20.199 --> 00:00:22.053
We’ll compare it with your Day 30 clip.

00:00:22.272 --> 00:00:23.933
For coaching, I’ll send you a short drill.

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:26.236
Watch my demo and practice it.

00:00:26.505 --> 00:00:29.001
Then film yourself doing that same drill

00:00:29.237 --> 00:00:30.148
and send it to me.

00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:33.020
Here’s what my feedback looks like.

00:00:33.627 --> 00:00:35.327
Let’s watch yours next to mine.

00:00:36.067 --> 00:00:37.087
See that fourth step?

00:00:37.377 --> 00:00:39.727
We both land right on the beat. Nice.

00:00:40.417 --> 00:00:42.097
Now watch your eighth step.

00:00:42.317 --> 00:00:44.407
Your foot touched down a little bit early.

00:00:45.077 --> 00:00:47.257
And here’s mine, right on the beat.

00:00:47.777 --> 00:00:49.447
That’s the spot to work on.

00:00:49.687 --> 00:00:53.067
Practice that section until each step lands on the beat.

00:00:53.447 --> 00:00:55.937
Then film a fresh clip and send it back.

00:00:56.227 --> 00:00:57.587
I’ll check your timing again.

00:00:57.973 --> 00:01:01.507
Then try a few reps whenever
you have a spare moment:

00:01:01.592 --> 00:01:03.260
at your desk, at lunch,

00:01:03.417 --> 00:01:04.606
or while you’re waiting in line.

00:01:05.034 --> 00:01:08.986
On Day 30, film the same part of the same song
so you can see what changed.

00:01:09.153 --> 00:01:12.354
The next time a friend holds out her hand, picture yourself taking it.

00:01:12.354 --> 00:01:14.254
Know what to do when the music starts.

00:01:14.254 --> 00:01:15.345
Feel great doing it.

00:01:15.592 --> 00:01:18.977
I review every clip myself, so space is limited.

00:01:19.337 --> 00:01:21.507
Please answer the next few questions honestly,

00:01:21.667 --> 00:01:24.287
so we can see if the coaching is a good fit for you.
